{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04393","headline":"感遇诗三十八首 十九 · 陈子昂","name":"感遇诗三十八首 十九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣人不利己，忧济在元元。\n黄屋非尧意，瑶台安可论。\n吾闻西方化，清净道弥敦。\n奈何穷金玉，雕刻以爲尊。\n云构山林尽，瑶图珠翠烦。\n鬼工尚未可，人力安能存。\n夸愚适增累，矜智道逾昏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈子昂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04393.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04393","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}